[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3955937504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116638#issuecomment-3955937504","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116638","id":3955937504,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rytDg","user":{"login":"ScatteredComet","id":120208759,"node_id":"U_kgDOByo9dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120208759?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet","html_url":"https://github.com/ScatteredComet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T01:25:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T01:26:15Z","body":"For me on PopOS disabling the option \"Make Game Workspace Floating on Next Play\" makes the game run from within the box:\n\n<img width=\"386\" height=\"189\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b67dd3d-01f5-49fe-a90d-7ca12778b478\"/>\n\nThe term \"embedded\" looks to refer to whether the options at the top (for game speed, pausing, selecting nodes, etc) appear in the same window as the game (embedded) or from the editor (not embedded). Maybe I am wrong though.\n\nOnly mentioning this because you don't mention changing this setting in your issue, and it looks to be the one you're looking for.\n\n---\n\nAs a side note I think it would be a good idea to clarify what \"embedded\" means here as I don't think its too obvious. I think \"embedded\" can be easily misunderstood as \"floating window\"; maybe a tooltip could be added that clarifies:\n\n- Embedded disabled: game runs in a seperate window with no menubar for debugging options. The floating window option in greyed out (looks to be irrelevant)\n- Embedded enabled, floating window disabled: The game runs from within the box in the game tab\n- Embedded enabled, floating window enabled: The game runs in a separate window, with a menubar for debugging options in it","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3955937504/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3968781284","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116638#issuecomment-3968781284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116638","id":3968781284,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sjsvk","user":{"login":"Shardj","id":5624120,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjQxMjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5624120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj","html_url":"https://github.com/Shardj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shardj/even